 "_doc": [
  "The Hyperreal models' animation contract before the Release 1.0 recast (game v6.3 behaviour, read from the Phase 0 model sources): the s fields each model read in update(dt, t, s). tests/purgatory/p8_recast.js feeds every one of them (0, 0.5, 1) to the rebuilt models, which must not throw, and requires each model to still read them (keep every s field the brain writes).",
  "exempt: fields that only toggled props the recast deleted (they may go). generic: the fields the adapter fills for every model (speed, yaw, pitch, hurt, dead, attack, seed, accel): fed to update() but a model need not read them. Model names are the Release 1.0 file names."
